      "anchor": "kickofflocal"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "`kickoffLocal` is the local development environment module for the `kickoff` application."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Use this module for local-only configuration and server composition. Shared application behavior belongs in `kickoffModules`, and server/node settings belong in child topology modules."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Local values should remain explicit, replaceable, and isolated from higher environments."
    }
  ],
